PN,40201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786991001
OL,3,C'My brother died from it, so can you',
OL,4,Csister tells teens to take Meningitis
OL,5,Cjab
OL,7,FThe sister of a teenager from Bristol
OL,8,Fwho died after contracting Meningitis
OL,9,Fat a festival is urging young people
OL,10,Fto take the free vaccine before
OL,11,Fstarting university.
OL,13,F18-year-old George Zographou was
OL,14,Fcelebrating his A-level results at
OL,15,FBoardmasters in 2017 when he caught
OL,16,Fthe disease.
OL,18,FTwo people died after an outbreak in
OL,19,FKent earlier this year but only a
OL,20,Fthird of those eligible in Cornwall
OL,21,Fhave taken up the time limited offer.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
