OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786991001
OL,3,C'My brother died from it, so can you',
OL,4,Csister tells teens to take Meningitis
OL,5,Cjab
OL,7,F"It's been nine years since my brother
OL,8,Fdied and we are really shocked and
OL,9,Fhurt this is still happening."
OL,11,F"It felt like it was happening to us
OL,12,Fall over again. We were incredibly
OL,13,Fdevastated and affected by the
OL,14,Fstudents who lost their lives in Kent.
OL,15,F"
OL,17,FAcross the South West more than 10,700
OL,18,Fyoung people had taken the opportunity
OL,19,Ffor a free Meningitis B vaccination.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786991001
OL,3,C'My brother died from it, so can you',
OL,4,Csister tells teens to take Meningitis
OL,5,Cjab
OL,7,FThe time-limited MenB vaccine is
OL,8,Favailable through GP practices for 17-
OL,9,F18 year olds and through community
OL,10,Fpharmacies for people under the age of
OL,11,F25 who will be starting university as
OL,12,Fundergraduates or moving into
OL,13,Fresidential further education settings
OL,14,Ffor the first time in autumn 2026.
OL,16,FBut teenagers at this year's
OL,17,FBoardmasters Festival had mixed
OL,18,Fopinions and information about how to
OL,19,Fget immunised.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786991001
OL,3,C'My brother died from it, so can you',
OL,4,Csister tells teens to take Meningitis
OL,5,Cjab
OL,7,FOne young man said he was emailed
OL,8,Fsigns and symptoms of Meningitis but
OL,9,Fdidn't know how to get the free
OL,10,Fvaccine.
OL,12,FAnother said he didn't believe he
OL,13,Fneeded in after already being in
OL,14,Funiversity for a year.
OL,16,FAnd a further group said they made
OL,17,Fsure they had their vaccines before
OL,18,Fattending Boardmasters festival, let
OL,19,Falone starting university.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786991001
OL,3,C'My brother died from it, so can you',
OL,4,Csister tells teens to take Meningitis
OL,5,Cjab
OL,7,FNicole Zographou, who began a career
OL,8,Fin public health after the death of
OL,9,Fher brother, says teenagers can feel
OL,10,F"invincible" when it comes to their
OL,11,Fhealth.
OL,13,F"When you're young you feel
OL,14,Finvincible. Meningitis can affect
OL,15,Fanybody, and it can affect people
OL,16,Fvery, very quickly.
OL,18,F"If you have a vaccine available to
OL,19,Fyou that's free, that families have
OL,20,Fbeen fighting for for years, then
OL,21,Fthere's no need to take that risk."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786991001
OL,3,C'My brother died from it, so can you',
OL,4,Csister tells teens to take Meningitis
OL,5,Cjab
OL,7,F"We do this to stop this from
OL,8,Fhappening to any other family."
OL,10,FDr Matthew Dominey, Immunisation Lead
OL,11,Ffor NHS England South West, says
OL,12,Fpeople need to remember to come back
OL,13,Fto their second jab.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1786991001
OL,3,C'My brother died from it, so can you',
OL,4,Csister tells teens to take Meningitis
OL,5,Cjab
OL,7,F"The Men B vaccine is a two-dose
OL,8,Fvaccination with doses given a least 4
OL,9,Fweeks apart. While many eligible
OL,10,Fpeople in the region have already
OL,11,Freceived their first vaccine, we
OL,12,Fencourage those who have not yet
OL,13,Fbooked to get their vaccine as soon as
OL,14,Fpossible so they can receive their
OL,15,Fsecond dose ahead of starting
OL,16,Funiversity this autumn."
OL,18,FMeningitis can kill within hours or
OL,19,Fleave survivors with life-changing
OL,20,Fafter-effects ` including limb loss,
OL,21,Fhearing loss and acquired brain injury.
OL,26,@oD@AOUxD@XO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
